,"h":3,"c":[0,1,2],"i":[["Eldrathium plate","item-metalplate-eldrathium",1,""],["Moonstone","item-rustboundmagic:moonstone",1,""],["Stick","item-stick",1,""]],"q":1}]},0,{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"r":[{"w":2,"h":2,"c":[0,0,0,0],"i":[["Rusty dust","item-rustboundmagic:rustydust",2,""]],"q":1}],"u":["item-rustboundmagic:rustydust"]},{"x":[["Created by","• Select from a <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:essencecore-light\">light essence core</a> or <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:essencecore-dark\">dark essence core</a>."],["Spell School Attunement","Not all spells are accessible for every mage. Spells outside of the 'General' spell school requires a mage to specialize in that spell school to be able to understand and cast those kind of spells.<br><br>Start by throwing [Q] a <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:riftcharge\">rift charge</a> into an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> to start essence infusion. When you have the resulting <a href=\"#s/essence%20core\">essence core</a>, <kbd title=\"rightmouse\">Right mouse</kbd> click it to mark the spell school on the core. Various cores will have different spell schools they can become. When a spell school is selected, [Sneak] + <kbd title=\"rightmouse\">Right mouse</kbd> click to start the conversion to an <a href=\"#s/attunement%20core\">attunement core</a>. After that, [Sneak] + <kbd title=\"rightmouse\">Right mouse</kbd> click again to soulbind to it. Once soulbound, equip it and the attunement process is done.<br><br>Mages can only be attuned to 1 spell school at a time. All mages have access to the 'General' spells regardless of attunement. When removing an <a href=\"#s/attunement%20core\">attunement core</a> there will be an exhaustion debuff that prevents attunement for a period of time."]]},{"x":[["Advanced Spell School Attunement","Not all spells are accessible for every mage. Spells outside of the 'General' spell school requires a mage to specialize in that spell school to be able to understand and cast those kind of spells. This attunement core takes it a step further enhancing the attributes for that specific spell school.<br><br>Start by throwing [Q] an <a href=\"#s/attunement%20core\">attunement core</a> into an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> to start essence infusion. Each core type will need specific essence:<br>    - Evocation core = neutral essence<br>    - Alteration core  = light essence<br>    - Incantation core = dark essence<br>    - Conjuration core = light or dark essence<br><br>When you have the resulting <a href=\"#s/attunement%20core%20%28Advanced%29\">advanced attunement core</a>, [Sneak] + <kbd title=\"rightmouse\">Right mouse</kbd> click to soulbind to it. Once soulbound, equip it and the attunement process is done.<br><br>Mages can only be attuned to 1 spell school at a time. All mages have access to the 'General' spells regardless of attunement. When removing any <a href=\"#s/attunement%20core\">attunement cores</a> there will be an exhaustion debuff that prevents attunement for a period of time."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Meditate while holding a single <a href=\"#p/item-bamboostakes\">bamboo</a>."],["Magic tool use","• Casts innate type spells."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Meditate while holding a single <a href=\"#p/item-bone\">bone</a>."],["Magic tool use","• Casts innate type spells."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Meditate while holding a single <a href=\"#p/item-stick\">stick</a>."],["Magic tool use","• Casts innate type spells."]]},{"x":[["Obtained by killing & harvesting","• Drifters, shivers, ..."],["Dropped by","• <a href=\"#s/magicstationancient\">Ancient artifacts</a>"],["rustboundmagic:handbook-spelldropentropy1-title","• Using 'Entropy I'."]],"u":["item-rustboundmagic:toolremovemagic"]},{"x":[["Remove magic","To remove all magic, <kbd title=\"Sneak\">Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Right mouse</kbd> click while holding this item and stay still for 10 seconds to finish the process. Doing so will remove all knowledge of magic. Be warned that there is a negative reaction to severing the connection to the rust..."]],"r":[{"w":3,"h":3,"c":[0,0,0,0,1,0,0,0,0],"i":[["Rot","item-rot",1,""],["Crystallized memories","item-rustboundmagic:crystallizedmemories",1,""]],"q":1}]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Processing <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:riftcharge\">rift charge</a> in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using dark essence."],["Spell School Attunement","Not all spells are accessible for every mage. Spells outside of the 'General' spell school requires a mage to specialize in that spell school to be able to understand and cast those kind of spells.<br><br>Start by throwing [Q] a <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:riftcharge\">rift charge</a> into an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> to start essence infusion. When you have the resulting <a href=\"#s/essence%20core\">essence core</a>, <kbd title=\"rightmouse\">Right mouse</kbd> click it to mark the spell school on the core. Various cores will have different spell schools they can become. When a spell school is selected, [Sneak] + <kbd title=\"rightmouse\">Right mouse</kbd> click to start the conversion to an <a href=\"#s/attunement%20core\">attunement core</a>. After that, [Sneak] + <kbd title=\"rightmouse\">Right mouse</kbd> click again to soulbind to it. Once soulbound, equip it and the attunement process is done.<br><br>Mages can only be attuned to 1 spell school at a time. All mages have access to the 'General' spells regardless of attunement. When removing an <a href=\"#s/attunement%20core\">attunement core</a> there will be an exhaustion debuff that prevents attunement for a period of time."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Processing an <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:essencelacrimainert\">inert essence lacrima</a> in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using dark essence."],["Essence Storage","This item can store or provide essence to essence generators of the same type.<br><br>The lacrima 'mode' (store or siphon) depends on the settings in the essence generator. The lacrima type must match the essence type. I.E. A 'celestial prism' generates 'light essence' and would use a 'light essence lacrima'."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Processing an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:manatorch-inert-lantern-up\">inert mana lantern</a> in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using dark essence."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Processing <a href=\"#p/block-torch-basic-lit-up\">torches</a> in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using dark essence."],["Magic Rechargable","This block can be recharged with the spell 'Transmutation' or by applying <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:rustydust\">rusty dust</a> directly to the block with <kbd title=\"Sneak\">Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Right mouse</kbd> click. The charge amount depends on the block itself."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Processing <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:runicscroll-tier1\">runic scroll I</a> in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using dark essence."],["Process with","• Spellforge"]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Ritual of Corruption"],["Dark essence generator","This magic station will generate dark essence by consuming the life force for creatures that get too close. This only works at night. Doesn't affect players.<br><br>For more information, refer to the <a href=\"#p/item-rustboundmagic:guidebook-beginner\">Manual of Magical Arts</a> book."],["Essence and leylines","Essence is an invisible force that exists everywhere in the world. This force comes in neutral, light, and dark types. Using a <a href=\"#s/resonator\">resonator</a>, a mage can make leyline connections from 'essence generators' to various 'magic stations' to supply them with essence."],["Magic station","These are essential blocks that are linked to various magic systems. Each magic station serves a specific purpose and are the foundations for magic progression."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-normal-core-north\">arclight furnace</a> using the same essence type as the grimoire."]]},{"x":[["Created by","• Synthesis with an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationoculus-normal-core-north\">oculus</a>."],["Repaired by","• Repair in an <a href=\"#p/block-rustboundmagic:magicstationarclightfurnace-norm